 class=\"ilh-paren\">\n       ）\n      </span>\n     </span>\n    </span>\n    )\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    {{\n    <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Template:恒星专题（页面不存在）\">\n     恒星专题\n    </a>\n    }}\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\">\n   <h2 id=\"专题評比\">\n    <span id=\".E4.B8.93.E9.A2.98.E8.A9.95.E6.AF.94\">\n    </span>\n    专题評比\n   </h2>\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection\">\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     [\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=WikiProject:%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"编辑章节：专题評比\">\n     <span>\n      编辑\n     </span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     ]\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    {{\n    <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Template:恒星专题（页面不存在）\">\n     恒星专题\n    </a>\n    }}\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>\n   可放在所有属于恒星专题的条目讨论页，以标示该条目的内容质量与重要性。\n   <a class=\"new\" href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:%E6%81%92%E6%98%9F%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Template:恒星专题（页面不存在）\">\n    Template:恒星专题\n   </a>\n  </p>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    请复制{{恒星专题|class=|importance=}}，貼到條目討論頁最頂端，並根據\n    <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E6%9D%A1%E7%9B%AE%E8%B4%A8%E9%87%8F%E8%AF%84%E7%BA%A7%E6%A0%87%E5%87%86\" title=\"Wikipedia:条目质量评级标准\">\n     Wikipedia:条目質量评级标准\n    </a>\n    為該頁面作出評價。\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <b>\n     现状\n    </b>\n    ：\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <table class=\"TOC\" style=\"table-layout:fixed;text-align:center;margin:1em auto;\">\n   <tbody>\n    <tr>\n     <th>\n      总计\n     </th>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <th>\n      0\n     </th>\n    </tr>\n   </tbody>\n   <caption align=\"bottom\">\n    <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">\n     恒星专题\n    </a>\n    各等级条目\n    <small>\n     